@startuml
title SEQ-04 - Practice Session, Exercise and Authoritative Attempt
autonumber
actor User
boundary Web
control GotIt
control Core
database DB as "product_gotit"
participant Speech as "Speech Provider (optional)"

User -> Web: Start smart/manual session
Web -> GotIt: POST /practice/sessions\nIdempotency-Key + type/scope/count
GotIt -> Core: Authenticate + practice.play entitlement
GotIt -> DB: Rank queue / validate explicit scope
critical Create or replay session
  GotIt -> DB: Save selection snapshot + receipt
end
GotIt --> Web: session
opt Introductory study
  Web -> GotIt: GET /sessions/:id/study
  GotIt -> DB: Load owned current-revision cards
  GotIt --> Web: source + primary translation
end
loop Until scoped rounds and any existing mistake repair finish
Web -> GotIt: POST /sessions/:id/exercises\nMatching board or ordinary smart round
GotIt -> DB: Create private exercises\nexpected answers + expiry + revision
GotIt --> Web: prompts/opaque choices only
Web --> User: Render exercise
User -> Web: Answer / choice / rating / skip
opt Pronunciation
  Web -> GotIt: POST /pronunciation/assessments\nWAV + exerciseId + Idempotency-Key
  GotIt -> Speech: Transient assessment
  Speech --> GotIt: transcript/confidence/score evidence
else Other exercise
  Web -> GotIt: POST /practice/attempts\nIdempotency-Key + one answer mode
end
critical Score and commit atomically
  GotIt -> DB: Lock exercise/session/item
  GotIt -> GotIt: Verify owner, expiry, unused, current revision
  GotIt -> GotIt: Calculate score/result/skill effects
  GotIt -> DB: Consume exercise + insert attempt/effects
  GotIt -> DB: Project skills/mastery/review schedule
  GotIt -> DB: Insert XP ledger + daily activity + algorithm event + receipt
end
GotIt --> Web: authoritative receipt
Web --> User: Feedback, XP, progress and next review
User -> Web: Continue (fresh board / ordinary round)
end
Web -> GotIt: PATCH /sessions/:id status=completed
GotIt --> Web: Completed session
Web --> User: Session summary
note over Web,GotIt
The client never submits score, result, XP or mastery.
Skip creates no learning progress, streak or XP.
end note
@enduml
